<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei","Source Han Sans SC","Noto Sans SC",sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>按方法族看：经典方法全面领先，深度学习整体掉队</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)' }}>CRT 应答预测 · AI 模型基准对比</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 560, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 540, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
        <Image src="assets/family_boxplot.png" style={{ width: 500, height: 534, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
      <Table
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 240 }}
        defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 14.5, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
        defaultCellStyle={{
          border: {
            left: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
            right: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
            top: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
            bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
          },
        }}
        cells={[
          [
            { text: '方法族', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: '模型数', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: '族均 AUC', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: '族内最佳', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
          ],
          [
            { text: '集成之集成', textStyle: { bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: '3', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: '0.797', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: 'Stacking 0.802', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          ],
          ['核方法/贝叶斯', '5', '0.785', 'GP 0.801'],
          ['线性/正则化', '10', '0.761', 'LDA_S 0.809'],
          ['树模型与集成', '9', '0.728', 'ExtraTrees 0.795'],
          ['筛选消融', '4', '0.685', 'SVM_rbf_s 0.739'],
          [{ text: '深度学习', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#D9534F' } }, { text: '6', textStyle: { color: '#D9534F' } }, { text: '0.627', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#D9534F' } }, { text: 'FT-T 0.676', textStyle: { color: '#D9534F' } }],
        ]}
      />
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 13 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>读图要点　</Text>
          箱体为每个模型 25 个外层折的 AUC 分布（菱形=均值）。<br />
          领先梯队由<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>集成之集成 + 核方法 + 收缩判别</span>构成；<br />
          红色（深度学习）全部位于基线（0.746）以下，与文献中"小样本表格数据深度学习无优势"的系统证据一致。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, background: '#FFF8E6', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, border: '1px solid #F0DFA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#7A6420' }}>消融发现：单变量筛选对 SVM/RF 无增益（0.790→0.739 / 0.742→0.700）——强正则模型自己会处理弱特征</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB', background: '#F7F9FC' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>南京医科大学第一附属医院 · 心律失常团队</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>11 / 15</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
